---
import EventGroupPage from '../components/EventGroupPage.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<EventGroupPage sectionKey="projects" title="Project Events" active="project-events" pageMark="🏗️">
  The choices that appear when a city finishes a <strong>Project</strong>. A one-time project, such as
  the <a href={`${base}urban-improvements`}>Archive</a>, Forum, Walls, Treasury, Sangam or Opulence, has its own
  event, like a <a href={`${base}wonder-events`}>wonder event</a>. A repeatable project (Festival, Hunt, Olympiad)
  rolls one event from a weighted pool each time you run it. The Festival has the largest pool.
</EventGroupPage>
